{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10136180","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10136180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1013618001:3":{"text":"サジタリス様！なぜここに！？","source_cn":"萨基塔里斯大人！您为什么在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E03C9D6B633429","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013618002:1":{"text":"ちょうどいいところに来たようだな。いや、むしろ逆か？","source_cn":"我来得巧了。或者说，不太巧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DB8FBA5A7A5F7FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013618003:1":{"text":"ふっ、こんなことなら我の竪琴を持ってくるべきだったな。このような場面に伴奏がないとは実に勿体ない！","source_cn":"呵，真该带上我的竖琴的。此时此刻的情节，不觉得正适合伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CFB40CD276730D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013618004:2":{"text":"……うわっ！？な、なんの音です！？","source_cn":"……唔啊！什、什么声音！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE181B2A84E24FE5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013618005:1":{"text":"誰ですか！ロンロンを起こしたのは！？","source_cn":"是、是谁把满满吵醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44EDD23EF402D39A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013618006:2":{"text":"この音は……え？アタランテさん？せ、聖石町に連行されたはずでは……どうしてここに！？","source_cn":"发出声音的是——咦，阿塔兰忒？你、你不是被送回圣石镇了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A06B143E27F8E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013618007:1":{"text":"当然ここにいるべきさ、彼女はこの喜劇のヒロインなのだからね。","source_cn":"当然要在场了。她可是这场人间喜剧重要的女主角。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0793206A2247B823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013618008:1":{"text":"え？喜劇？何の喜劇……って、サジタリス様ではないですか！","source_cn":"啊？喜剧？什么喜剧……说话的居然是萨基塔里斯阁下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10B538380C8B8CD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013618009:0":{"text":"我もこの喜劇の大事な観客の一人だからな。","source_cn":"自然因为我也是这场喜剧重要的观众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88CC7286CBD19A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1013618009":{"text":"我もこの喜劇の大事な観客の一人だからな。","source_cn":"自然因为我也是这场喜剧重要的观众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88CC7286CBD19A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1013618010:0":{"text":"喜劇だからといって、始終笑いが絶えないとは限らん。それにデューラも悲劇なんて観たくはないだろう。","source_cn":"喜剧并不一定全然是欢笑。但艾雅在上，总不会放任此事变成悲剧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48AFBDC998201C48","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"喜劇だからといって、始終笑いが絶えないとは限らん。それにデューラも悲劇なんて観たくはないだろう。","female":"喜劇だからといって、始終笑いが絶えないとは限らん。それにデューラも悲劇なんて観たくはないだろう。","variant_male_record_index":"115030","variant_female_record_index":"115031","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1013618012:1":{"text":"実に見事な内容だったぞ、次の一幕が始まったらまた呼んでくれたまえよ。","source_cn":"不过，精彩的一幕结束了。下一幕再呼唤我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A42CAA3ABD59F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"喜劇というのは本当か？","source_cn":"会是喜剧吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4613D2691F805FAA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"喜劇というのは本当か？","female":"喜劇というのは本当なの？","variant_male_record_index":"62194","variant_female_record_index":"62195","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1013618011:1":{"text":"誇張、ユーモア、転換はあれど、結末はきっと悪くない。","source_cn":"夸张、诙谐、转折，但结局总归不差。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x30C6E74E48E5BC2D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"誇張、ユーモア、転換はあれど、結末はきっと悪くない。","female":"誇張、ユーモア、転換はあれど、結末はきっと悪くない。","variant_male_record_index":"115032","variant_female_record_index":"115033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"どうして喜劇なんだ？","source_cn":"为什么是喜剧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BDC63D9160F4911","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どうして喜劇なんだ？","female":"どうして喜劇なの？","variant_male_record_